The SOC Level 2 role includes a wide range of responsibilities that you will cover throughout the SOC Level 2 learning path. But triage of escalated alerts remains the core duty, as every reported case might indicate an exfiltration attempt, ransomware, or even a wiper. In this room, you will learn the Level 2 workflow during alert triage and see how it differs from Level 1.

